sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant CA as Care app
  participant E as Entra ID
  participant G as HL7 Edge Gateway
  participant M as MEDITECH
  participant SL as Salesforce login
  participant SA as Salesforce Apex REST
  CA->>E: client credentials (scope: gateway API /.default)
  E-->>CA: access token (aud = gateway API, roles = Hl7.Send)
  CA->>G: POST /hl7/orders (Bearer token, ORM^O01)
  G->>E: fetch signing keys (cached)
  G->>G: check signature, issuer, audience, expiry, role
  G->>M: ORM^O01 (MLLP :6661)
  M-->>G: ACK AA
  G-->>CA: 200 with MEDITECH's ACK
  M->>G: ORU^R01 (MLLP :7890)
  G-->>M: ACK AA (stored)
  G->>SL: JWT bearer assertion (signed with the private key)
  SL-->>G: access token and instance URL
  G->>SA: POST /services/apexrest/Hl7Inbound
  SA-->>G: 200, HL7 ACK AA
